em_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/abd3a941e9aeed27fde48ad7401c33dc.poster.avif?t=1753606369\" width=680 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/abd3a941e9aeed27fde48ad7401c33dc.webm?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/abd3a941e9aeed27fde48ad7401c33dc.mp4?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unstoppable Stalkers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever you go, danger awaits you. Your enemies are looking for you. Speed and stealth are your best weapons. Various gadgets can bail you out, but they are only a minor help in an unequal fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/64e846cc01eebfe8e5f54d41ce5c3f9e.poster.avif?t=1753606369\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/64e846cc01eebfe8e5f54d41ce5c3f9e.webm?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/64e846cc01eebfe8e5f54d41ce5c3f9e.mp4?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The future is uncertain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's plot is non-linear, and your adventure can change markedly depending on the decisions you make. Your actions will have consequences, and not all of them are obvious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets await you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is full of mysteries and secrets. Pick locks, find passwords and solve logic puzzles to unlock the secrets of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create to survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and collect resources to create all the necessary consumables and supplies. Without them you can't survive in a post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/a5844b239233cbf9128fe819b1b7c821.poster.avif?t=1753606369\" width=616 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/a5844b239233cbf9128fe819b1b7c821.webm?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659170/extras/a5844b239233cbf9128fe819b1b7c821.mp4?t=1753606369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from creepy monsters and avoid deadly traps in the 2D horror adventure Shadow Pulse. Stealth and speed are your best weapons. Madness and death await at every turn. Will you be able to unravel the mysteries of this post-apocalyptic world?",
